{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119001042473-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119065346\"/><p>客貨車撞壆後翻側。</p><p>昨日(18日)下午4時許，一輛輕型貨車沿九龍塘窩打老道往獅子山隧道方向行駛，期間懷疑路面濕滑跣胎失控，撞向路中分隔石壆後翻側，橫亘快線上，尾隨車輛隨即煞車。事件中，姓蘇(44歲)女司機並無受傷。警員正調查意外起困。事發時，有車Cam拍下發生意外一刻的經過。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T23:04:27.722196+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T16:10:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T23:57:53.700752+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T22:57:57.412055+00:00","content_hash":"109ca79146cb5cd58f43f38277177fa8be6dbd60de948c1d0f8e8c7df710ccc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}